# Windows batch files must be CRLF for cmd.exe (LF-only can break goto/labels).
# Mark them as binary (-text) so git stores the bytes exactly -- this makes BOTH
# `git clone` and GitHub's "Download ZIP" (git archive, which does not apply eol
# conversion) deliver proper CRLF files. Commit these .bat files with CRLF endings.
*.bat -text
